ound of this video is transparent. Realistic style.\n\n10.\nThis video has a transparent background.  \nA burst of pink smoke rises and swirls upward.  \nThe background of this video is transparent. Realistic style.\n\n11.\nThis video has a transparent background.  \nA camera flash effect shines with lens reflections.  \nThe background of this video is transparent. Realistic style.\n\n12.\nThis video has a transparent background.  \nA realistic hand draws a glowing heart in the air.  \nThe background of this video is transparent. Realistic style.\n\n13.\nThis video has a transparent background.  \nA businesswoman gives a friendly wave and smile.  \nThe background of this video is transparent. Realistic style.\n\n14.\nThis video has a transparent background.  \nA colorful 3D text saying “Subscribe Now!” animates into view.  \nThe background of this video is transparent. Realistic style.\n\n15.\nThis video has a transparent background.  \nA realistic cat jumps and lands gracefully.  \nThe background of this video is transparent. Realistic style.\n\n16.\nThis video has a transparent background.  \nA golden ring of fire spins in the air before fading out.  \nThe background of this video is transparent. Realistic style.\n\n17.\nThis video has a transparent background.  \nSparkling stars form a trail that curves across the frame.  \nThe background of this video is transparent. Realistic style.\n\n18.\nThis video has a transparent background.  \nA futuristic drone flies by and disappears.  \nThe background of this video is transparent. Realistic style.\n\n19.\nThis video has a transparent background.  \nA splash of water slowly forms the shape of a logo.  \nThe background of this video is transparent. Realistic style.\n\n20.\nThis video has a transparent background.  \nAn abstract energy wave moves smoothly across the screen.  \nThe background of this video is transparent. Realistic style.\n\n---------------------------------------\nEnd of file\n---------------------------